I don't know any Slashem specifics, but in Vanilla these things should 
be true:

alignment adjustment - cause
-3 - As a lawful Archaeologist, digging up a grave
-1 - As any other lawful, digging up a grave
ref: http://www.steelypips.org/nethack/pray.html#app

actions that abuse your wisdom
* Digging into a grave
* Engraving on a gravestone
ref: http://www.geocities.com/dcorbett42/nethack/exercise.htm#WISAB


AFAIK, luck and god's anger is not affected by anything that has to do 
specifically with graves.

So it seems, unless Slashem does it some other way, that wisdom abuse is 
the only penalty that you would get for gravedigging with your current 
character.

